<% if @unknown_sender %>
  <p>
    We couldn't find an HCB account for <%= @to %>. Try sending your receipt again from the email address you use to log in to HCB.
  </p>

  <p>
    Or, send it to your personal Receipt Bin address, which accepts receipts from any email address. You can find it on your <%= link_to "Receipts page", my_inbox_url %>.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    This isn't a valid Receipt Bin inbox. You can find yours on your <%= link_to "Receipts page", my_inbox_url %>.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  From,<br>
  The HCB Team
</p>
